<title>USA: Baxter launches renal disease affiliate.</title>
<headline>Baxter launches renal disease affiliate.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baxter International Inc's Baxter Healthcare Corp said Tuesday it launched a new renal disease management affiliate.</p>
<p>The new unit, Renal Management Strategies Inc, will create nephrologist-led renal care networks around the country, Baxter said. It has created an affiliation with New Jersey Renal Management Llc, which will focus on securing capitated, risk-sharing contracts for management of renal patients in New Jersey.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
